 across the organization.</span></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">\\u00A0</span></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">As part of a team of engineers and technology experts, </span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">you'll</span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> deliver mission-critical services that help our customers manage, protect, and </span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">maintain</span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> millions of endpoints and servers \\u2014 designing and developing high-availability software systems that support our global operations.</span></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">\\u00A0</span></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">We are hiring for Staff Level candidates </span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;font-weight: bold;\\\">across multiple product teams</span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">! You will have an opportunity to learn about each team during your </span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">initial</span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(29,28,29);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> Recruiter interview or when speaking with a VP of Engineering in the interview pro