mily: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;\\\">and </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-weight: bold;\\\">Postgres</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;\\\">;</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;\\\"> supporting millions of user endpoints and running as a scalable cloud service in </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-weight: bold;\\\">AWS</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;\\\">.</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;\\\">\\u00A0</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;\\\"> Knowing large-scale datastore bottlenecks, asynchronous application design and client-server architecture will help you.</span></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;\\\">\\u00A0</span></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-weight: bold;\\\">What You\\u2019ll be Doing</span></p><ul style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;padding-left: 0.0pt;\\\"><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;font-weight: bold;\\\">Technical Leadership & Architecture: </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">Influence critical architectural decisions and oversee the implementation of complex technical solutions. Bring deep </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">expertise</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> in system design to ensure the long-term sustainability and scalability of our software systems, balancing technical debt, performance concerns, and business needs.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;font-weight: bold;\\\">Autonomous Decision-Making: </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">Operate</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> with a high degree of independence, trusted to make high-impact technical choices with minimal oversight. You are a go-to voice for evaluating trade-offs and setting direction across your domain.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;font-weight: bold;\\\">Cross-Functional Collaboration: </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">Partner with product, infrastructure, and engineering teams to drive alignment on technical decisions and ensure solutions are both practical and forward-looking.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;font-weight: bold;\\\">Mentorship & Standards:</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> Mentor and elevate engineers across the organization, providing guidance on best practices and helping </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">establish</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> technical standards that raise the bar for the entire engineering team.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;font-weight: bold;\\\">Ownership of Large-Scale Initiatives:</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> Take full ownership of complex, multi-team technical initiatives \\u2014 proactively </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">identifying</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> challenges, driving resolutions, and incorporating insights from customer support and operational data.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;font-weight: bold;\\\">Quality Advocacy:</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> Champion and implement quality assurance practices, ensuring the delivery of robust, high-performance software that meets the </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">high expectations</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> of our customers.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 8.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">Other duties as needed</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> </span></li></ul><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;\\\">\\u00A0</span></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-weight: bold;\\\">About You</span></p><ul style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;padding-left: 0.0pt;\\\"><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">12+ years of experience in Java software development, particularly for product applications.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">5+ years of experience designing and </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">operating</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> highly scalable systems.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">Proven experience solving complex system design challenges at scale.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">Expertise</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> in API design and RESTful services, with experience using frameworks like Spring (Spring Boot) or Jersey.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">Strong command of object-oriented programming (OOP) design principles and practices.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">Proficient in relational database design and development.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">2+ years of experience with Kotlin is a plus.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">Experience with caching systems, particularly Redis, is a plus.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">In-depth knowledge of quality testing practices and </span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">a track record</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\"> of delivering high-quality software.</span></li><li style=\\\"font-family: serif;font-size: 11.0pt;line-height: 108.0%;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 8.0pt 26.85pt;padding-left: 9.15pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">Bachelor's degree in computer science</span><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-style: normal;\\\">, Computer Engineering, Information Technology, or equivalent work experience.</span></li></ul><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;\\\">\\u00A0</span></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255,0,0);font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;\\\">\\u00A0</span></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0.0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11.0pt;font-styl